@base=http://localhost:8000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Status
GET {{base}}/api/status

### OpenAPI JSON
GET {{base}}/openapi.json

### Diagnostics - Routes
GET {{base}}/api/diag/routes

### Diagnostics - Alembic
GET {{base}}/api/diag/alembic

### Auth - Register (dev)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password",
  "name": "User"
}

### Auth - Login (dev)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password"
}

### Auth - Profile (dev)
GET {{base}}/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer dev-token-for-user@example.com

### Catalog - List Courses
GET {{base}}/api/courses?page=1&per_page=5

### Catalog - Get Course
GET {{base}}/api/courses/1

### Catalog - List Lessons
GET {{base}}/api/courses/1/lessons

### WS Help
GET {{base}}/api/ws-help
